BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Party with No Small Talk
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T020000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1635728@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Sports Fitness
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer\n\nCherry\, On Top\n​A part
 y with no small talk.\n​San Francisco has enough networking events.\n\n
 ​This is not one of them.\n​On Friday night\, Cherry is taking over No
 vela for DJs\, dancing\, drinks\, and conversations that skip straight pas
 t “so\, what do you do?”\n​The only rule: don’t ask anyone what th
 ey do for work.\n​You can ask about sex\, money\, dating\, periods\, div
 orce\, kids\, bad decisions\, whether you should text them back\, or the m
 eaning of life.\n​Just no small talk.\n​Come with your friends. Come o
 n a date. Come alone and meet someone you probably never would have talked
  to otherwise.\n​Expect local female DJs\, dancing\, Cherry cocktails\, 
 anonymous confessions\, questions you’d normally only ask your group cha
 t\, unexpected conversation starters\, and a few surprises we’re keeping
  secret until you get there.\n​Cherry has always been about the things w
 e’re actually thinking about but somehow still whispering about. This is
  a party about saying them out loud.\n​And yes\, you’ll get a first lo
 ok at what Cherry has been building and what’s coming next.\n​But most
 ly\, we want you to leave thinking: that was a really f*cking fun night.\n
 ​MUSIC\n​Local female DJs\, to be announced.\n​DRESS CODE\n​Cherry
 -coded cocktail attire. Fun\, girly\, a little nostalgic\, a little unexpe
 cted.\n​Red encouraged\, but not required.\n​TICKETS\n​Founding 100:
  $15\nEarly Bird: $20\nGeneral Admission: $25\nFinal Release: $30\n​Pric
 es increase as each release sells out.\n​Tickets include entry to our...
 \n\n$15.00\n\nTickets: https://luma.com/cherry-4hn8\nDetails: https://sf.f
 uncheap.com/party-small-talk/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screen
 shot-2026-09-08-at-6.11.37-PM.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Novela\, 662 Mission Street\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/party-small-talk/
END:VEVENT
