BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SF’s Annual “Blessing of the Animals” (2026)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T111500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T121500
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1634062@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerJoin friends and neighbors in 
 the parish courtyard for our annual blessing of the animals.\nYou are welc
 ome to bring your leashed pet or keep your pet in a carrier. We welcome al
 l pets: furry\, scaly\, and feathery\, as well as stuffed animals or pictu
 res of your pet!\n\nThis special event is free and open to ALL community m
 embers of any religious affiliation. On this day\, we celebrate the Feast 
 Day of Saint Francis of Assisi\, patron saint of animals\, our church\, an
 d the City of San Francisco. All of God’s creatures are welcome. Pet own
 ers can show appreciation for their pets\, make new friends\, and share th
 e company of other animals and their owners. You can also help us make tre
 ats for the animals at the San Francisco Animal Care and Control. St. Fran
 cis’ clergy will bestow individual blessings on every animal in attendan
 ce.\nThe event will take place outside in our parish courtyard at 11:15 AM
 .\nSt. Francis’ Church is located near the Ocean Avenue and Junipero Ser
 ra MUNI Stop and offers plenty of free street parking.\n\nFree\n\nTickets:
  https://www.eventbrite.com/e/annual-blessing-of-the-animals-st-francis-da
 y-tickets-1999124694777?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.co
 m/sfs-annual-blessing-animals-2026/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/202510
 05_110742.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:St. Francis Episcopal Church\, 399 San Fernando Way\, San Francis
 co\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-annual-blessing-animals-2026/
END:VEVENT
