 at is heaven for Bay Area inline skaters and roller skaters who like to bo
 ogie to the funky beat on wheels.\nThe Godfather of Skate brings his mobil
 e DJ unit and plays groovy tunes for you to skate to. On most Sundays\, th
 ere’s usually someone willing to teach you a few choreographed roller di
 sco dance moves.\n\nGolden Gate Park Sunday Roller Disco Party\nMost Sunda
 ys | Noon to 5 pm\n6th Ave & Kennedy Drive\, Golden Gate Park\nFREE\nThe a
 rea is is called\, “Skatin’ Place.” It is located at 6th Avenue and 
 Kennedy Drive in the park. It has been officially dedicated and recognized
  as the home for outdoor roller skating in the San Francisco.\nSkatin’ P
 lace is available for skating every day. The group skates there every Sund
 ay from noon to 5 pm. Skaters gather on Wednesdays from about 3 to 5 pm an
 d on Saturdays from 1 to 5 pm. During Daylight Saving Time\, they extend t
 he time to 6 pm.\nUpdated 5/24/21 – Event confirmed via website.\n\nUpco
