DESCRIPTION:SF’s “Electric Dream Home 2026” Mobile Showroom (Oct. 8-
 10)\nElectric Dream Home 2026: Test Modern Appliances (SF)\nElectric Dream
  Home is a mobile electric-appliance showroom appearing at Civic Center Pl
 aza on October 8\, 2026 and Pier 35 on the Embarcadero on October 10\, 202
 6. Visitors can explore electric appliances in a home-like setting\, inclu
 ding induction cooktops\, heat pumps\, and electric fireplaces\, while lea
 rning about their air-quality\, comfort\, performance\, and climate benefi
 ts.\nCome experience the Electric Dream Home:\nThursday\, October 8\, 10am
  to 6pm — Civic Center Plaza\nSaturday\, October 10\, 10am to 5pm — Pi
 er 35 on the Embarcadero\nOriginal Event Description:\nElectric Dream Home
  is coming to San Francisco from October 8 to 10. This mobile display lets
  you explore electric appliances in a home-like setting and imagine how th
 ey might fit into your life. Join us to explore and learn how to improve a
 ir quality in your home.\nCome experience the Electric Dream Home:\nThursd
 ay\, October 8\, 10am to 6pm — Civic Center Plaza\nSaturday\, October 10
 \, 10am to 5pm — Pier 35 on the Embarcadero\nThe shift from gas to elect
 ric is already underway\, with the Bay Area Air District finalizing zero e
 missions water heater rules this November. Modern appliances make everyday
  life more convenient and comfortable while helping San Francisco build a 
 healthier\, climate-friendly future. The Electric Dream Home gives you the
  chance to see that performance for yourself!\nThe Electric Dream Home is 
 a m...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.sfenvironment.org/blog/five-reasons
 -why-life-better-electric\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-electric-d
 ream-home-2026-mobile-showroom-oct-810/\nSource: Funcheap SF
