BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nevada City All-Inclusive Foraging Retreat w/ Sauna + Yuba River S
 wims (Oct 8-12)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T120000
DTSTAMP:20261007T060815Z
UID:funcheap-1634289@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerFork In The PathThis retreat i
 ncludes 3 nights of camping with hot showers\, all meals with farm and for
 aged fresh ingredients\, and 4 days of Sierra Nevada ecological and foragi
 ng programming\, including:\n\nswimming in the Yuba River\nedible & medici
 nal plant foraging\nbasket weaving from gourds & pine needles\nmaking natu
 ral sodas\nacorn & bay nuts\n\nWe’ll be camping together on a beautiful 
 ranch with a sauna that’s 5 minutes from the river\n\nAbout Fork In The 
 Path\nFork In The Path offers transformational foraging experiences in Cal
 ifornia for the adventurous of all ages.\nJoin us for a fun all-inclusive 
 campout weekend filled with the fall foraged treasures of the Sierra Footh
 ills\, featuring acorns\, bay nuts\, plants\, making natural sodas with wi
 ld yeasts and plants\, weaving baskets from gourds and pine needles\, and 
 more!\nRosebud Ranch will be our home base for our weekend in Nevada City.
  They have a beautiful wooden bathhouse with hot showers\, a cob wood-fire
 d sauna\, a fire pit with a stage for open mic (if you wish)\, and a shade
 d camping area. They are located just 5 minutes from the Hoyt Crossing of 
 the glorious Yuba River\, where you can swim in the limestone green waters
  to your heart’s content.\nThree meals a day will be provided\, which ar
 e a mix of foraged and farm-fresh ingredients.\nCampout begins at 3pm on T
 hurs\, and ends at 12 pm on Sunday\, Oct 8-12th\, 2026.\nCampout Draft Sch
 edule *\n*All activities are optional – the schedule is a draft\, the or
 d...\n\n$701.00\n\nTickets: https://www.forkinthepath.org/registration-fal
 l-retreat-nevada-city-2026\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/nevada-city-f
 oraging-campout/\nSource: Funcheap SF
