UID:funcheap-1639103@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:© Out There WatercolorsFree outdoor painting gathering at the
  Palace of Fine Arts.\nCome paint with us. Sign up at Painters Unite to he
 ar about future gatherings.\nPainters Unite is a free gathering for anyone
  who wants to slow down and paint outdoors\, together. No class\, no press
 ure\, nothing for sale.\nI’m Marco Flavio\, a watercolor teacher here in
  the city. I started this because so many people told me they wanted more 
 time to paint and to be around others\, and I think that shouldn’t have 
 to cost anything. I’ll be painting right alongside you\, same as everyon
 e.\n\nThis time we’re meeting at the Palace of Fine Arts\, at the inters
 ection of Baker Street and Beach Street at 10AM. From there we’ll have a
  beautiful view across the lagoon toward the Palace\, with the architectur
 e\, water\, and reflections all in front of us. It’s a great opportunity
  to play with reflections in watercolor and simplify a pretty spectacular 
 scene into a painting.\nAs always\, I’ll bring a few small challenges\, 
 different ways of seeing and painting what’s in front of us. I’ll also
  have a limited number of pre-drawings of the Palace of Fine Arts on water
 color paper\, first come\, first served\, for beginners who’d like a sta
 rting point. Take a challenge\, use a pre-draw\, or simply find a spot and
  paint. No experience needed.\nBring a sketchbook and something to draw or
  paint with. If you have a watercolor kit\, bring it. A folding or camping
  chair is welcome\, or a mat or blanket to sit on. Anything that makes it 
 comfo...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.outtherewatercolors.com/painters-
 unite\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-outdoor-painting-gathering-pa
 lace-fine-arts-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
