SUMMARY:Follow the Music
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T150000
DTSTAMP:20261008T185326Z
UID:dothebay-17687565@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:3
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation
DESCRIPTION:Free RSVP\n\nSince launching in 2023 Follow the Music has been
  at the forefront of a rising movement promoting arts education around the
  Bay Area. The nonprofit organization introduces its next phase with an em
 erging artists music festival designed to showcase aspiring young musician
 s. Bringing families and young people from all over the region to the urba
 n oasis of the Gardens\, Follow the Music celebrates the Bay Area’s unri
 valed cultural heritage by building a bridge between that legacy and the y
 oung people carrying it forward. Featuring musicians ages 14-25\, the even
 t includes musicians from the San Francisco Community Music Center\, Oakla
 nd School for the Arts\, SFJAZZ\, GLIDE Memorial Church\, Blue Bear School
  of Music\, Elevate Oakland\, Enriching Lives Through Music and other orga
 nizations. Drawing on the Bay Area’s cultural diversity\, the lineup cro
 sses genres from classical and jazz to soul\, rock and Latin jazz. It also
  features guest speakers from music\, sports and popular culture. A commun
 ity resource fair provides families and students with opportunities to con
 nect directly with many Bay Area music education programs while learning a
 bout classes and scholarships. The muse can take many pathways and Follow 
 the Music is here to ensure that all are open.\n\nOakland Rising\, a colle
 ctive developed in partnership with Follow the Music\, anchors the program
