  San Francisco.\nAdo’s dark\, explosive track “Monstruo” is an absol
 ute powerhouse. Applying 20 years of dance-fitness expertise\, SFJay engin
 eered a brand-new\, original “Monster Concept” routine—combining dra
 matic movement\, beast-mode athletic stances\, and fun strikes into choreo
 graphy that actually flows\, feels amazing to execute\, and hits every bea
 t of the music.\nWhat to Expect:\nWorld-Debut Choreography: Learn the firs
 t-ever dedicated dance routine created specifically for Ado’s Monstruo.\
 nFeature in the Fitness Music Video: We will be filming live group footage
 ! Come bring your energy and star in the official full-length fitness musi
 c video release for YouTube\, Instagram\, and TikTok.\nTheatrical & Athlet
 ic: A step-by-step breakdown of claw strikes\, low-center beast transition
 s\, and high-octane cardio drops—featuring beginner\, intermediate\, and
  advanced options so everyone can dance!\n100% Free & Open to All: No prio
 r dance experience required—just bring your enthusiasm and smile!\nYour 
 Stage: Salesforce Park (Main Plaza)\n️ Date: Sunday\, October 11th\n⏰ 
