DESCRIPTION:San Francisco Old Car PicnicThe 38th annual San Francisco Old 
 Car Picnic returns to Hellman Hollow\, also known as Historic Speedway Mea
 dow\, in Golden Gate Park. Spectators can attend free to see eligible 2001
 -and-older cars\, trucks\, motorcycles\, and bicycles parked on the meadow
 . Vehicle-entry donations benefit programs for people with developmental d
 isabilities\; no pre-registration\, vendors\, or amplified music are plann
 ed.\nOriginal Event Description:\n_38th Annual San Francisco Old Car Picni
 c\nOCTOBER 17\, 2026\nGATES 7AM-4PM\nFree for the public\nOCTOBER 2026\n38
 th ANNUAL\nSAN FRANCISCO\nOLD CAR PICNIC\nHellman Hollow (aka Historic Spe
 edway Meadow)\nGolden Gate Park\nSan Francisco\, CA\nGet Directions\nCome 
 celebrate an annual San Francisco classic car tradition in beautiful Golde
 n Gate Park.\nCars & Trucks $40\nMotorcycles $20\nBicycles $10\nSpectators
  FREE\n2001 or older year limit for vehicles.\nNo vehicles larger than 3/4
  ton pickup.\nNo other vehicles allowed on meadow. No exceptions.\nNo in &
  outs.\nNo amplified music.\nSf classic car 6\nTHE SAN FRANCISCO OLD CAR P
 ICNIC\nINFORMATION\nDirections\nSpeedway Meadow is located within Golden G
 ate Park in San Francisco. It’s near 30th Avenue\, on John F. Kennedy Dr
 ive\, west of Crossover/Transverse Drive.\nPLEASE NOTE: Vehicles MUST ente
 r the Meadow coming east from Ocean Beach\, on JFK Drive. OR enter the Par
 k at 30th Avenue from Fulton\, then turn LEFT onto JFK Drive.\nSan Francis
 co Old Car Picnic benefits programs for the developmentally disabled.\nCod
 e of...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/p/DdX3mbBsnj3/?utm_s
 ource=ig_web_copy_link&amp\;stkn=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==\nDetails: https://sf.fun
 cheap.com/38th-annual-sf-car-picnic-2026-classic-vehicles-golden-gate-park
 /\nSource: Funcheap SF
