DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerCK Contemporary“Sanctuary”
  brings together the large-scale landscape paintings of William Nichols an
 d the emotionally charged pencil drawings of Sara Gallagher in an exhibiti
 on exploring nature as a site of refuge\, restoration\, and human connecti
 on.\nThe exhibition opens with a reception on Saturday\, October 17th from
  5-8 PM. Refreshments will be served and both artists\, William Nichols an
 d Sara Gallagher will be in attendance. We look forward to seeing you ther
 e!\nIf you are unable to attend the opening reception\, the exhibition wil
 l be on view until November 14th.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://ckcontempora
 ry.com/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sanctuary-exhibition-opening/\nS
