CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:Make a Friend Picnic 2026: BYO Picnic Setup (SF)Make a Friend 
 Picnic is a casual outdoor social meetup at Potrero del Sol Park for peopl
 e looking to meet new people in San Francisco. Attendees are asked to brin
 g their own blanket\, drinks\, snacks\, and other picnic supplies. The hos
 t plans informal activities to make conversations easier\, and Athena the 
 dog will also attend.\nOriginal Event Description:\n_Make a Friend Picnic\
 nA REAL UPDATE: WE HAVE A DATE. 🎉\nMost importantly: you’re all aweso
 me.\nYou signed up to a stranger’s event because you wanted to make a fr
 iend. You put yourself out there to meet people you don’t know\, which i
 s hard\, and you did it anyway.\nSo thank you. That took guts\, and I wasn
 ’t going to let that go to waste.\nWhen I first made this event\, it was
  20 people and a blanket. Then it became 505 of you\, plus a waitlist\, wh
 ich was genuinely insane and also one of the nicest things that’s happen
 ed since I moved here.\nNaturally\, that also created a tiny logistical pr
 oblem: several hundred people showing up to a public park requires a permi
 t.\nSo I went to SF Rec and Park\, explained exactly what happened\, and a
 fter a lot of back and forth\, we officially have a new plan: October 18 a
 t Potrero Park.\nSince this has become much bigger than the original “pe
 ople sitting on blankets making friends” plan\, I’m also putting toget
 her a few fun\, easy activations to help people connect once they get ther
 e. Nothing mandatory or overly structured\, just things that make talking 
 to a...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://partiful.com/e/NnTYzma0yrGAehRuRl1v?so
 urce=discover\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-friend-picnic-bringyou
 rownblanket-potrero-del-sol-park/\nSource: Funcheap SF
