  families\, and their friends. A pop-up marketplace for every pet lover. T
 hat’s what’s in store for the first annual Wags & Wheels October 31st 
 at Fisherman’s Wharf.\nFree to attend\, and free to bring the whole crew
 !\n\nWhat to Expect\n\nFree entertainment & activities — Photo opps with
  a Giant Corgi Butt\, dog run\, lawn games\, all day doggy disco with live
  DJs\, demos\, and more.\nLive costume contests with prizes — Multiple c
 ompetition categories for dogs and their human companions. $5–$20 slidin
 g-scale donation to our adoption partner required for entry. Win cash priz
 es or make a donation in your honor to our adoption partner.\nTrunk or Tre
 at — trick-or-treat your way down a row of decorated classic cars. $5-20
  sliding scale donation to our adoption partner for entry – comes with f
 ree face painting and Hot Wheels race entry.\nPet Marketplace — Shop fro
 m pet food\, gear\, accessories\, and meet local pet service organizations
 .\n\nGetting In\nFree General Admission — Watch the costume contest\, vo
 te on the best trunk-or-treat host\, shop the marketplace\, and enjoy the 
 free activities and entertainment.\nTrunk or Treat Pass — $5\nA donation
