DESCRIPTION:Ranch First Wednesday Open Community Day | Napa\npatch\nCome a
 nd walk-in every first Wednesday of every month from 3-5 pm in the spring\
 , summer and fall\, and from 2-4 pm in the winter.\nRanch First Wednesday 
 Open Community Day\nEvery First Wednesday\nConnolly Ranch\, 3141 Browns Va
 lley Road\, Napa\nFREE (RSVP requested but not required)\n$5 donation sugg
 ested per person\, but no one is turned away for lack of funds.\nDuring th
 e open community day\, Connolly Ranch welcomes old friends to visit and ne
 w friends to discover the ranch for the first time. Once a month\, the ran
 ch will be open for the public to visit the garden\, relax in the grove\, 
 take a hike on the woodland trail and see the animals—on your own\, or b
 ring your family and friends.\n\nInterested in becoming a Connolly Ranch C
 ommunity Partner? Community partners interested in hosting interactive act
 ivities at future Walk-in Wednesdays or other community events should emai
 l: hylah@connollyranch.org.\n– Updated 6/26/19 – Event info last check
