DESCRIPTION:Golden Gate Park Sunday Roller Disco Party (SF)\nElliot Dumond
 e via D. Miles\nThere is a place in San Francisco’s Golden Gate Park tha
 t is heaven for Bay Area inline skaters and roller skaters who like to boo
 gie to the funky beat on wheels.\nThe Godfather of Skate brings his mobile
  DJ unit and plays groovy tunes for you to skate to. On most Sundays\, the
 re’s usually someone willing to teach you a few choreographed roller dis
 co dance moves.\nGolden Gate Park Sunday Roller Disco Party\nMost Sundays 
 | Noon to 5 pm\n6th Ave & Kennedy Drive\, Golden Gate Park\nFREE\nThe area
  is is called\, “Skatin’ Place.” It is located at 6th Avenue and Ken
 nedy Drive in the park. It has been officially dedicated and recognized as
  the home for outdoor roller skating in the San Francisco.\nSkatin’ Plac
 e is available for skating every day. The group skates there every Sunday 
 from noon to 5 pm. Skaters gather on Wednesdays from about 3 to 5 pm and o
 n Saturdays from 1 to 5 pm. During Daylight Saving Time\, they extend the 
 time to 6 pm.\nUpdated 5/24/21 – Event confirmed via website.\n\nUpcomin
 g Golden Gate Park Sunday Roller Disco Party (SF) Events\nSun 10/11 Golden
  Gate Park Sunday Roller Disco Party (SF)Sun 10/18 Golden Gate Park Sunday
  Roller Disco Party (SF)Sun 10/25 Golden Gate Park Sunday Roller Disco Par
 ty (SF)Sun 11/1 Golden Gate Park Sunday Roller Disco Party (SF)Sun 11/8 Go
 lden Gate Park Sunday Roller Disco Party (SF)Sun 11/15 Golden Gate Park Su
 nday Roller Disco Party (SF)Sun 11/22 Golden Gate Park Sunday R...\n\nFree
 \n\nTickets: https://goldengatepark.com/6th-avenue-skate-park.html\nDetail
 s: https://sf.funcheap.com/golden-gate-park-sunday-roller-disco-party-sf-3
 04/\nSource: Funcheap SF
