DESCRIPTION:San Francisco Critical Mass (Last Friday of the Month)\nSF Cri
 tical Mass\nCritical Mass is a mass bicycle ride that takes place on the l
 ast Friday of each month in San Francisco. Meet and 6pm\, ride at 6:30 pm 
 from Embarcadero Plaza (foot of Market Street) and in cities around the wo
 rld. Everyone is invited. No one is in charge. Bring your bike.\nPlease No
 te: Critical Mass tends to practice extreme bike power by taking to the st
 reets and riding in the car lanes causing endless annoyance to motorists.\
 nIn San Francisco especially\, this event can get HUGE. Consider this is f
 air warning to stay away from driving in the downtown SF area on the last 
 Friday of every month.\n\nUpcoming San Francisco Critical Mass (Last Frida
 y of the Month) Events\nFri 10/30 San Francisco Critical Mass (Last Friday
  of the Month)Fri 11/27 San Francisco Critical Mass (Last Friday of the Mo
 nth)Fri 12/25 San Francisco Critical Mass (Last Friday of the Month)Discla
 imer: Please double check event information with the event organizer as ev
 ents can be canceled\, details can change after they are added to our cale
 ndar\, and errors do occur.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.facebook.com/s
 fcriticalmass/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/san-francisco-critical-ma
 ss-last-friday-of-the-month-19/\nSource: Funcheap SF
